  "policy_notes": [
    "Return planners capture ordered original live ordinary minion references. Lost, transformed, transferred or replaced board incarnations do not redirect to a later target.",
    "Twilight Matriarch returns eligible enemy minions to original owners. Waggle Pick returns one random eligible friendly minion to its current controller hand, with the existing successful-return cost operation.",
    "Web of Deception summons its actual 4/4 Stealth Spider only after successful physical return. Stale or full-hand failed return gives no success continuation under explicit local policy awaiting CN calibration.",
    "Random return has one weight per original live physical candidate, uses the common RNG once, and preserves the selected reference through return; empty candidates consume no RNG.",
    "Dimensional Weaponsmith gives captured original own hand minions and weapons +2 Attack; weapon Health/durability is unchanged. Hourglass Attendant buffs captured original own hand minions +1/+1 at its normal own-turn-end trigger.",
    "No formal legal or generation pool is inferred from this registered subset; exact current CN return timing and full-hand behavior remain uncalibrated."
